---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: How to procure us
summary: Bluebird Advisory is proud to be a trusted supplier to both Federal Government and State Government through a number of key procurement panels. These are the panels you can procure our services through.
---
{% include "partials/page-hero.njk" %}
{% for g in panels %}
<section class="wrap section">
  <h2 class="section-title">{{ g.heading }}</h2>
  <ul class="panels">
    {% for p in g.panels %}
    <li>
      <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3>
      <div class="prose small">{{ p.details | md | safe }}</div>
      {% if p.url %}<p><a class="text-link" href="{{ p.url }}">View panel details</a></p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{% endfor %}
<section class="band-mist"><div class="wrap section">
  <h2>Need more detail on these panels?</h2>
  <p><a class="btn" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email {{ site.email }}</a></p>
</div></section>
